    "body": "## Summary\n\n- Removes the \"Create Label\" button and inline `LabelPublisherInline` form from the report detail view\n- The button had a UX bug: clicking it hid the button and rendered the form in a different scroll zone above the action bar, making it appear like nothing happened\n- Manual labeling was never part of the active moderation workflow — the AI moderation service auto-publishes kind 1985 labels, and moderators act via direct RPC actions (ban, suspend, delete)\n- The standalone `LabelPublisher` component and Labels tab are retained\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Verify report detail view renders without \"Create Label\" button\n- [ ] Verify no TypeScript errors (`npx tsc --noEmit`)\n- [ ] Verify Labels tab still works independently",
