    "body": "## Summary\n\n- Replace local `getReportCategory` in `Reports.tsx` with the identical export from `src/lib/constants.ts`\n- Replace local `HIGH_PRIORITY_CATEGORIES` (6 entries) with the shared version from `constants.ts` (8 entries, includes `NS-underageUser` and `NS-childSafety`)\n\nThe local `HIGH_PRIORITY_CATEGORIES` was missing child-safety categories, so those reports were not getting priority badges, destructive border styling, or elevated sort position in the queue list — even though they appeared correctly flagged in the detail pane.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] `npx tsc --noEmit` — clean\n- [x] No behavior change for `getReportCategory` — functions were identical\n- [x] Bug fix for `HIGH_PRIORITY_CATEGORIES` — child-safety reports now get priority treatment in queue list\n\nCloses #81",
